  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">更好的鐵魔像</span>&nbsp;</strong></p><p>&nbsp;<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/337/595/2021-02-01_12.png\" width=\"584\" height=\"329\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/hAEMtp5Y6R\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1101404304155365450?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Discord&amp;\" alt=\"BaguChan的Discord\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>描述：</strong></span><br>此模組強化了鐵魔像！<br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">它們現在更強大了，並增加了幾個新機制。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>功能（1.16.5~）：</strong></span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;- 鐵魔像遠程攻擊<br></span></p><p><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span><span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-</span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">裝甲閥值</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span><br></span></span></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>致謝：<br></strong></span>&nbsp;- 8HP（模組圖標）<br>&nbsp;- Evo（文檔撰寫）<br><br></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如果您想討論我的模組，請加入我的Discord！</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/4J22MZyNSU\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/4J22MZyNSU</a></span></p>",
